kingres (@DEB_VERSION@-@REVISION@) noble; urgency=medium

  * First packaging of KingresDB for PostgreSQL @PG_MAJOR@ (@PG_VERSION@): the
    PostgreSQL based server with the kingres_columnar, kingres_ledger,
    kingres_shard, kingres_sketch and kingres_timepart extensions, kingresd
    with the embedded management panel, kingres-verify, and the kingres.service
    unit.
  * One package per PostgreSQL major, in the version: +pg18 and +pg19.  The
    maintainer script refuses to replace the one by the other.
  * KingresDB's own code is under AGPL-3.0-only; the PostgreSQL files keep the
    PostgreSQL License (see the copyright file).

